  "text": "THROUGH the Spring-thickened branches<br>I see it floating,<br>An ivory dome<br>Headed to gold by the dim sun.<br><br>It hangs against a white-misted sky,<br>And the swollen branches<br>Open or cover it,<br>As they blow in the wet wind.",
